  "description": "Sky Hop gives the old seesaw a new action. Instead of sitting and bumping, a child holds the bars, pulls with their body weight and hops upward off the stepping pads. The frame is crane-shaped and finished in Mineral with Sand Beige. It suits ages 5 to 12 and is slim, with a product area of 11'3\" x 2' and a safe play area of 17'3\" x 6'. That narrow footprint lets it sit along a path or between larger play pieces. Hopping, hanging and jumping work on upper body strength, coordination, balance and body awareness. The structure carries a 3-year warranty on galvanised pipe and roto-moulded parts. Call us on +91 902 830 2266 and we will check whether it suits your age group.",
